WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Step 1: Select a step in Checklist builder and choose a native response type, such as checkbox, text, number, selection, photo or signature.

2
00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:14.083
Step 2: Set required status, options or numeric precision where available.

3
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:20.083
Step 3: Use instructions or section headings to explain the task; these are not responses.

4
00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:27.208
Step 4: Configure timed sections when a minimum elapsed process is needed, then review the complete checklist before planning it.
